Certificate compatibility layer inspired by ys1231/MoveCertificate.
Upstream: https://github.com/ys1231/MoveCertificate
Reviewed revision: 5775fbd43c2dedfcc66e375d6692e0846f3ea334
License: Apache License 2.0 (included in LICENSES/MoveCertificate-Apache-2.0.txt).

The compatibility design (Android <=13 system store versus Android >=14
Conscrypt APEX, active APEX aliases and init/zygote mount namespaces) informed
this independently implemented Go certificate manager. Original upstream shell
files are not bundled or executed. Unlike the reference implementation, this
module does not move user CAs, chmod user stores, delete certificates by name,
or install a second certificate-management module/server.
